  "details": "I use 3rd person, and with this Udon update, there are some really cool worlds that use locomotion. Neat flying stuff, things like that. I want to be able to do that, but I still can't handle artificial locomotion. Things like FOV reduction, 2d screen mode, grid lines. Games like Climbey, Google Earth VR, and Rec Room are good examples of comfort options. I wanna be able to fly around with my friends too!",
